OL,3,GNEWSAMaura Higgins to fill Cilla
OL,4,ABlack's shoes as host of Blind Date
OL,5,Areboot
OL,6,
OL,7,FMaura Higgins is set to follow in the
OL,8,Ffootsteps of the late Cilla Black as
OL,9,Fpresenter of Blind Date in a reboot of
OL,10,Fthe popular TV show.
OL,12,FThe Irish TV personality rose to fame
OL,13,Fin 2019 as a finalist on another dating
OL,14,Fshow, Love Island, and more recently
OL,15,Fappeared on the US version of The
OL,16,FTraitors.
OL,18,FThe original Blind Date launched on ITV
OL,19,Fin 1985 and was a staple of Saturday
OL,20,Fnight TV for nearly 20 years, with
OL,21,Fwell-liked Liverpudlian singer and
OL,22,Factress Black its host.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
