OL,3,GNEWSAMaura Higgins to fill Cilla
OL,4,ABlack's shoes as host of Blind Date
OL,5,Areboot
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is being revived by Disney+, and on
OL,8,FWednesday the streamer mimicked one of
OL,9,FBlack's old Blind Date catchphrases in
OL,10,Fits announcement on Instagram: "'Blind
OL,11,FDate host, what's your name and where
OL,12,Fd'ya come from?' It's... Maura
OL,13,FHiggins."
